script`\r\n- moves TypeScript CI, endpoint auditing, integration tests, Dependabot, release-please, npm publishing, and GitHub Packages publishing into monorepo-aware root workflows\r\n- retargets Agent Server version-bump automation to update `clients/typescript` in this repository and gates Python release/eval workflows from TypeScript release tags\r\n\r\n## Issue Number\r\n\r\nRelates to #4586\r\n\r\n## How to Test\r\n\r\nFrom the repository root:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncd clients/typescript\r\nnpm ci\r\nnpm run test:agent-server-api-tooling\r\nnpm run check:agent-server-api\r\nnpm run test:public-type-budget\r\nnpm run check:public-type-budget\r\nnpm run lint\r\nnpm run build\r\nenv -u AGENT_SERVER_URL -u LLM_API_KEY -u LLM_MODEL -u LLM_BASE_URL npm test -- --runInBand\r\nnpm run format:check\r\nnpm run test:endpoint-audit-tooling\r\nnpm run audit:endpoints\r\nnpm audit --audit-level=moderate --omit=dev\r\nnpm pack --dry-run\r\n\r\ncd ../..\r\nOPENHANDS_SUPPRESS_BANNER=1 uv run python clients/typescript/scripts/check-acp-drift.py\r\nuv run pytest tests/cross/test_prepare_typescript_client_agent_server_bump.py\r\nuv run pyright\r\n```\r\n\r\nObserved results:\r\n\r\n- 18 Jest suites passed; 309 tests passed\r\n- checked-in Agent Server contract is current for v1.44.0\r\n- public weak-type budget remains at 103 sites\r\n- ACP providers match the Python SDK\r\n- 7 release-bump helper tests passed\r\n- npm production audit found 0 vulnerabilities\r\n- npm dry-run produced `@openhands/typescript-client@1.39.0`\r\n- repository pre-commit hooks and Pyright passed\r\n\r\n## Video/Screenshots\r\n\r\nNot applicable; this is a repository and release-infrastructure migration with no UI behavior change.\r\n\r\n## Design Doc\r\n\r\nThe PR description documents the migration layout, release separation, and validation. No temporary design artifact was added.\r\n\r\n## Type\r\n\r\n- [ ] Bug fix\r\n- [x] Feature\r\n- [x] Refactor\r\n- [ ] Breaking change\r\n- [x] Docs / chore\r\n\r\n#